# Worker Types Package (`packages/worker-types`)

This package provides shared TypeScript types for worker queues and jobs used across the Skymo platform.

## Key Files & Directories:
- **[`types/`](mdc:packages/worker-types/types)**: TypeScript type definitions for different worker jobs.
  - **[`account-deletion.ts`](mdc:packages/worker-types/types/account-deletion.ts)**: Defines `AccountDeletionJobData` for user account deletion tasks.
  - **[`gameStorage.ts`](mdc:packages/worker-types/types/gameStorage.ts)**: Defines `GameStorageJobData` for storing completed games in the database.
  - **[`mailer.ts`](mdc:packages/worker-types/types/mailer.ts)**: Defines `MailerJobData` for email sending tasks.
  - **[`postgres-cleanup.ts`](mdc:packages/worker-types/types/postgres-cleanup.ts)**: Defines types for PostgreSQL cleanup tasks.
- **[`package.json`](mdc:packages/worker-types/package.json)**: Dependencies and scripts.
- **[`tsconfig.json`](mdc:packages/worker-types/tsconfig.json)**: TypeScript configuration.

## Notes
- All types follow the [TypeScript best practices](mdc:.cursor/rules/lib/typescript.mdc).
- Types are used by both the API (job producers) and workers (job processors).
- Job data interfaces ensure type safety across the queue system.


## Notes
- This package should only contain type definitions and simple, shared validation schemas, following [TypeScript best practices](mdc:.cursor/rules/lib/typescript.mdc).
- It helps decouple the API from the workers, allowing them to be developed and deployed independently.
